<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-12">
        <div class="card shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body p-5">
                <h1 class="mb-4">About WanderLust</h1>
                <p class="text-muted"><em>Discover your next adventure</em></p>

                <section class="mt-4">
                    <h3>Who We Are</h3>
                    <p>WanderLust is a full-stack travel marketplace where hosts can publish boutique stays, guests can browse curated destinations, and authenticated users can leave verified reviews. We combine modern technology with a passion for travel to deliver an experience that makes finding your perfect getaway effortless.</p>
                    <p>From hidden cabins to colorful city lofts, WanderLust curates stays that feel like a warm embrace. Take a deep breath, pack light, and let your next story unfold where the horizon is wide open.</p>
                </section>

                <section class="mt-4">
                    <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                    <p>Our mission is to connect travelers with unique accommodations and experiences around the world. We believe that travel should be accessible, authentic, and memorable. Whether you're seeking a peaceful retreat or an urban adventure, WanderLust helps you find places that make you feel most alive.</p>
                </section>

                <section class="mt-4">
                    <h3>What We Offer</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Curated Listings:</strong> Browse through carefully selected accommodations that range from cozy cabins to vibrant city apartments.</li>
                        <li><strong>User Reviews:</strong> Read authentic reviews from verified guests to make informed decisions about your stay.</li>
                        <li><strong>Easy Booking:</strong> Simple and secure booking process with instant confirmation.</li>
                        <li><strong>Host Your Space:</strong> Share your unique space with travelers from around the world and earn extra income.</li>
                        <li><strong>Trusted Community:</strong> Join a community of travelers and hosts who share a love for exploration and hospitality.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section class="mt-4">
                    <h3>Our Technology</h3>
                    <p>Built with modern web technologies, WanderLust offers a seamless experience across devices. Our platform features:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Secure user authentication and session management</li>
                        <li>Cloud-based database for reliable data storage</li>
                        <li>Image upload and optimization for fast loading</li>
                        <li>Responsive design for mobile and desktop</li>
                        <li>Real-time search and filtering capabilities</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section class="mt-4">
                    <h3>Join Our Community</h3>
                    <p>Whether you're a traveler seeking your next adventure or a host ready to share your space, WanderLust welcomes you. Create an account today and start exploring the world of unique travel experiences.</p>
                    <p>Connect with us on social media and stay updated with the latest destinations, travel tips, and community stories.</p>
                </section>

                <section class="mt-4">
                    <h3>Contact Us</h3>
                    <p>Have questions or feedback? We'd love to hear from you!</p>
                    <p><strong>Email:</strong> contact@wanderlust.com<br>
                    <strong>Address:</strong> WanderLust Private Limited, India</p>
                </section>

                <div class="mt-5">
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Start Exploring</a>
                    <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-outline-primary ms-2">View All Listings</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
